# NOT ignored, on purpose: examples/*/public/audio/vo/*.mp3
# The voice-over is generated (`npm run vo`) but vendored, so a fresh clone
# renders the film without an API key and CI can prove the cut still composes.
# It is ~2 MB. If your film's narration grows past a few minutes, ignore it
# and generate in CI instead.
